  "id": "recipe-zimage-turbo.inpaint",
  "revision": 1,
  "title": "Z-Image Turbo: inpainting",
  "description": "Repaints the masked area of a source image from the prompt with Z-Image Turbo. InpaintModelConditioning encodes the source and sets the mask as the latent's noise mask, KSampler samples 9 steps at CFG 1.0 and denoise 0.77, and ImageCompositeMasked puts the repainted area over the source, so the pixels outside the mask are the source's and the output has the source image's size. The mask is a separate image in ComfyUI's input folder, white where the image is repainted, read from its red channel by LoadImageMask. Lower denoise keeps more of the source inside the mask.",
  "kind": "image",
  "operations": [
    "inpaint"
  ],
