      "observedAt": "2026-11-16T10:02:07+01:00",
      "note": "Components as in recipe-zimage-turbo.t2i: z_image_turbo_bf16, qwen_3_4b, the Z-Image ae.safetensors; CFG 1.0 because Turbo is distilled. The installed VAE matches the flux-ae family rule, the family the skill and this recipe call z-image-vae."
