    {
      "kind": "upstream_pack",
      "source": "packs/z-image-turbo-inpainting/workflow.json at fork baseline 707474d2 (blob 3dc586db)",
      "observedAt": "2026-11-16T10:02:07+01:00",
      "note": "The graph follows the pack's Z-IMAGE TURBO INPAINTING slice: InpaintModelConditioning with noise_mask on, KSampler 9 steps, CFG 1, euler, simple, denoise 0.77, VAEDecode, then ImageCompositeMasked of the result over the source. The pack loads GGUF files through custom nodes (UnetLoaderGGUF, CLIPLoaderGGUF, type lumina2) and blurs the mask with MaskBlur+ (ComfyUI_essentials); this recipe loads the bf16 files with the core loaders and composites with the unblurred mask, since no core node blurs a mask. The pack takes the mask from the painted image's alpha; this recipe takes it from a separate mask file, the task's mask input."
    },
